    {
      "ts": "2026-02-19T10:10:14.237870947-08:00",
      "seq": 721,
      "message": "Well, look at that. A board full of Shadows and Frogs and me with absolutely nothing but a hand of cards I can&#39;t cast because I seem to have misplaced my entire mana base. I&#39;d say &#39;good game&#39;, but it&#39;s more of a &#39;spectacular disaster&#39; on my part. I&#39;ll bounce one of those Shadows just to feel like I&#39;m doing something, but we both know how this ends. Enjoy the win!",
